mer service, by enabling more comprehensive, accurate, and engaging interactions between humans and machines."}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 1: {'task': {'task': 'summarization', 'id': 1, 'dep': [0], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'response': 'The main topics in "AI systems collaborate across modalities" include multimodal interaction, where AI systems process and integrate multiple forms of data such as text, images, and speech to achieve a common goal. This collaboration enables AI to better understand and generate human-like responses, improving overall performance in applications like human-computer interaction, natural language processing, and computer vision. Additionally, it involves the development of models that can seamlessly switch between different modalities, enhancing their ability to learn from diverse data sources and adapt to new situations.'}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 2: {'task': {'task': 'text-classification', 'id': 2, 'dep': [1], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'error': 'no available models on text-classification task.'}, 'choose model result': ''}}
